{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《99 Tasks》是一款專為 iPhone 和 iPad 設計的本地優先任務管理工具，適合想保持待辦清單簡潔、專注當前工作的用戶。它提供 99 個可見任務槽，並支援快速輸入、子任務、備註、截止日期、提醒、智能分類及私密語意搜尋。原價 US $3.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>固定任務槽保持專注</h2>\n<p>快速輸入任務後，可拆成子任務、加入備註、設定截止日期與本地提醒。My Day、Focus 和 Important 標籤有助優先排序，關鍵字與主題標籤會自動產生智能分類；裝置上的語意搜尋可按意義查找，無須帳戶即可離線使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-376-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-377-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-378-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-379-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-380-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-381-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：99 Tasks</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T11:39:30.817356+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}